---
// src/components/Footer.astro
---
<footer class="footer">
  <div class="footer__inner">
    <div class="footer__brand">
      <div class="footer__logo">
        <span class="footer__logo-en">Angel Center</span>
        <span class="footer__logo-ja">ぶっこうどう</span>
      </div>
      <p class="footer__tagline">葬儀後の供養事をトータルでサポートする<br>専門の窓口サービスです。</p>
      <address>
        <p>〒XXX-XXXX ○○県○○市○○町X-X-X</p>
        <p>TEL: <a href="tel:0120XXXXXX">0120-XXX-XXX</a></p>
        <p>受付時間 9:00〜18:00（年中無休）</p>
      </address>
    </div>

    <div class="footer__links">
      <div class="footer__col">
        <h3>SERVICES</h3>
        <a href="/services/estate">遺品整理</a>
        <a href="/services/junk">不用品回収</a>
        <a href="/services/antique">古物買取（4月〜）</a>
        <a href="/services/altar">仏壇・仏具販売</a>
        <a href="/services/cemetery">墓地・霊園紹介</a>
      </div>
      <div class="footer__col">
        <h3>MORE SERVICES</h3>
        <a href="/services/altar-remake">仏壇リメイク</a>
        <a href="/services/grave-closure">墓じまい</a>
        <a href="/services/grave-keeping">墓守代行</a>
        <a href="/services/ocean">海洋散骨</a>
        <a href="/services/memento">手元供養品販売</a>
      </div>
      <div class="footer__col">
        <h3>COMPANY</h3>
        <a href="/about">会社概要</a>
        <a href="/staff">スタッフ紹介</a>
        <a href="/blog">ブログ</a>
        <a href="/voices">お客様の声</a>
        <a href="/contact">お問合せ</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer__bottom">
    <p>© 2026 エンジェルセンター ぶっこうどう All Rights Reserved.</p>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
.footer {
  background: var(--green-dark);
  color: rgba(255,255,255,.85);
  font-family: var(--sans);
}

.footer__inner {
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 5rem 2rem 3rem;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;
  gap: 4rem;
}

.footer__logo {
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; line-height: 1.3; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
}
.footer__logo-en { font-family: var(--roman); font-size: .75rem; letter-spacing: .15em; font-style: italic; color: rgba(255,255,255,.6); }
.footer__logo-ja { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: .12em; color: #fff; }

.footer__tagline { font-size: .82rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,.7); }

address {
  font-style: normal; font-size: .8rem; line-height: 2; color: rgba(255,255,255,.65);
}
address a { color: rgba(255,255,255,.85); }

.footer__links {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 2rem;
}

.footer__col h3 {
  font-family: var(--roman); font-size: .72rem; letter-spacing: .2em;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,.5); margin-bottom: 1rem; padding-bottom: .5rem;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);
}

.footer__col a {
  display: block; font-size: .8rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,.7);
  padding: .3rem 0; transition: color .2s;
}
.footer__col a:hover { color: #fff; }

.footer__bottom {
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);
  text-align: center;
  padding: 1.25rem;
  font-size: .72rem;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,.45);
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .footer__inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2.5rem; }
  .footer__links { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
}
@media (max-width: 480px) {
  .footer__links { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}
</style>
